(7046352, 1071205, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful monochrome image. If I didn''t know better, I would say this was taken with the Leica Monochrome M. Very clean and beautiful tones.</td>', 'Very beautiful monochrome image. If I didn''t know better, I would say this was taken with the Leica Monochrome M. Very clean and beautiful tones.', '2013-06-01 23:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
