(7046358, 1070332, 112739, '<td valign="top">Well done! The processing on this is just right. The clouds are jumping off my screen. And I love that I can see all the details way back in the image. The light is beyond beautiful.</td>', 'Well done! The processing on this is just right. The clouds are jumping off my screen. And I love that I can see all the details way back in the image. The light is beyond beautiful.', '2013-06-01 23:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
