(7046660, 1070785, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 9s - I like it a lot. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Super-captivating subject, just sat there like a woman of the world.<br/> <br/>2. The juxtaposition of the bar and child.<br/> <br/>3. Her intent look - not caring about our photographic presence.<br/> <br/>4. The trick of making her look abandoned - of course we know someone is holding the camera, but it is effective nonetheless.<br/> <br/>5. Great tones and the slight grain. Excellent.<br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 9s - I like it a lot. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Super-captivating subject, just sat there like a woman of the world. 2. The juxtaposition of the bar and child. 3. Her intent look - not caring about our photographic presence. 4. The trick of making her look abandoned - of course we know someone is holding the camera, but it is effective nonetheless. 5. Great tones and the slight grain. Excellent. Great shot.', '2013-06-02 15:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7046661, 1071377, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 9s - I like it a lot. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. I like how you have embraced the shadows and how you have allowed it to confer anonymity.<br/> <br/>2. The long, long legs and pointy toes - part perspective, part poise.<br/> <br/>3. Bold use of the empty space above.<br/> <br/>4. The inclusion of the shutter panels - I like those.<br/> <br/>5. The open story - we really could overlay anything here.<br/> <br/>Great stuff.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 9s - I like it a lot. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. I like how you have embraced the shadows and how you have allowed it to confer anonymity. 2. The long, long legs and pointy toes - part perspective, part poise. 3. Bold use of the empty space above. 4. The inclusion of the shutter panels - I like those. 5. The open story - we really could overlay anything here. Great stuff.', '2013-06-02 15:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7046662, 1071109, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: <br/> <br/>1. Not an original motif, but so well done that it feels fresh.<br/> <br/>2. Perfect toning.<br/> <br/>3. Great use of structure/local contrast - bags of detail but still looks smooth and not at all crunchy.<br/> <br/>4. Brilliant contrast - I love those deep ''blacks''.<br/> <br/>Great stuff.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:  1. Not an original motif, but so well done that it feels fresh. 2. Perfect toning. 3. Great use of structure/local contrast - bags of detail but still looks smooth and not at all crunchy. 4. Brilliant contrast - I love those deep ''blacks''. Great stuff.', '2013-06-02 15:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7046663, 1069010, 47597, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. I like the light and expression.</td>', 'Very interesting image. I like the light and expression.', '2013-06-02 15:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7046665, 1069304, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: <br/> <br/>1. Beautiful image with loads going on.<br/> <br/>2. So many birds to look at but that shadow bottom left makes the image.<br/> <br/>3. I really like the figure too though.<br/> <br/>4. The leading lines of the causeway is highly effective.<br/> <br/>Excellent image.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:  1. Beautiful image with loads going on. 2. So many birds to look at but that shadow bottom left makes the image. 3. I really like the figure too though. 4. The leading lines of the causeway is highly effective. Excellent image.', '2013-06-02 15:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
