(7049499, 1070372, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s seen the slingshot and the pigs, hasn''t he &lt;sigh&gt;.  Innocence lost at such a young age.</td>', 'He''s seen the slingshot and the pigs, hasn''t he <sigh>.  Innocence lost at such a young age.', '2013-06-07 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
